  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating Disaster Risk Management Policy in Central America - Support to PCGIR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this grant is to support the implementation of the Central American Disaster Risk Management Strategy (Pol&#xed;tica Centroamericana De Gesti&#xf3;n Integral Del Riesgo de Desastres, PCGIR). This will be achieved by modernizing the regional DRM framework, strengthening information systems and communication networks and by supporting the design of a regional fund for DRM.</narrative>
  </description>
